_Backlog id `E0` · Phase 0 · Multi-village foundation_

## Goal

Secure sign-up and sign-in, role-based access, and a self-service profile (photo, language, theme).

## Business rules

- Forgot-password always returns the same response, so it does not reveal who is registered.
- A user edits only their own profile, even an admin.
- Changing the password needs the current password.
- Language and theme are stored on the account; a guest uses the device settings.
- Error `code` values never change; only the message is translated.

## Definition of done

- [ ] A token used after logout returns 401.
- [ ] A wrong-type or oversized image is rejected.
- [ ] A suspended user cannot sign in.
- [ ] The same error returns in Arabic and English with the same code.

