_Backlog id `E1` · Phase 1 · Users, roles & profile_

## Goal

The notification plumbing is ready, so any feature adds its notification in one line.

## Business rules

- A notification keeps a stable destination even if the target is deleted later (the server falls back).
- Users can mute kinds, except payment and security kinds.
- A broadcast never creates one row per user inside the request.

## Definition of done

- [ ] A test notification appears in the inbox and is marked read when opened.
- [ ] The unread counter updates after reading.
- [ ] Unit and request specs cover the notifier and the API.

