_Backlog id `E2` · Phase 2 · Notifications foundation_

## Goal

A complete directory of firms with details, working hours, location, search, filters and admin review.

## Business rules

- Any user can request a firm; the requester becomes its owner.
- An approved firm is public; today that also requires the owner's current subscription (see P5-02).
- A rejection needs a written reason; editing a rejected firm sends it back to pending.

## Definition of done

- [ ] The open-now filter is correct in the village time zone.
- [ ] A firm with missing required custom fields is accepted at first and rejected once those fields are edited.
- [ ] Approving or rejecting a firm sends a notification.

