_Backlog id `E3` · Phase 3 · Categories & firms catalog_

## Goal

A firm owner can invite partners, and each partner edits only the firms they belong to.

## Business rules

- `owner` can edit, invite and manage members; `manager` edits data and (later) media only.
- An invited person who is not registered receives the invitation after signing up with the same phone.
- A user can belong to several firms.
- The billing owner (`firms.owner_id`) keeps paying; members do not need a subscription (see P4-01).

## Definition of done

- [ ] A manager cannot invite or touch billing.
- [ ] The last owner cannot be removed.
- [ ] An owner of firm A cannot edit firm B.

