_Backlog id `E4` · Phase 4 · Multi-owner firms_

## Goal

One place decides what a firm may do, based on its owner's plan.

## Business rules

- A subscription belongs to the owner (user), so entitlements are resolved per owner.
- Plans with active subscriptions are never deleted, only deactivated.
- The price is copied into the subscription when it is requested (already done: `amount_cents`).

## Definition of done

- [ ] The same owner gets different limits before and after subscribing.
- [ ] No `if plan.name == ...` outside the entitlements service.

