_Backlog id `E5` · Phase 5 · Plans & entitlements_

## Goal

An owner pays by InstaPay or Vodafone Cash, an admin verifies the money, and the subscription renews and expires correctly.

## Business rules

- Nothing activates automatically from the app; a person verifies the transfer.
- A rejected request stays in the history; the owner can send a new one.
- Automation later: evaluate a provider that supports e-wallets and check its terms first.

## Definition of done

- [x] The same transfer reference is never accepted twice
- [ ] A subscription ends on time and the features lock after the grace period.
- [x] Approving a request twice activates it once

