_Backlog id `E6` · Phase 6 · Payments & subscription lifecycle_

## Goal

Only subscribers can add photos and videos, uploaded safely and lightly, with limits from the plan.

## Business rules

- Uploading without the entitlement returns 402.
- Deleting is always allowed, even after the subscription ends.
- A video is not shown publicly until processing finishes.

## Definition of done

- [ ] A video above the plan limit is rejected before the upload finishes.
- [ ] A video appears after processing with a thumbnail.
- [ ] A firm whose subscription ended shows no media publicly, and renewal restores it.

