## Goal

Subscribers appear first in a fair way and get visible benefits.

## Business rules

- Priority goes to subscribers, but rotates daily so the top spots are not permanently taken.
- A firm shown with priority is always labelled as featured.
- Sorting by nearest or by rating is not affected by the subscription.

## Definition of done

