_Backlog id `E8` · Phase 8 · Priority & subscriber benefits_

## Goal

A notification reaches the phone, and tapping it opens the right screen even when the app is closed.

## Business rules

- The payload carries a version; the app ignores destinations it does not know and opens the notifications screen.
- Opening a notification marks it read and records the open time.
- A push never carries sensitive details; the app fetches them from the API after opening.

## Definition of done

- [ ] A push received in the background opens the intended screen.
- [ ] A notification for a deleted item opens the notifications screen without a crash.
- [ ] An invalid token is removed from the table.

