_Backlog id `E13` · Phase 13 · Hardening & launch_

## Goal

The directory shows real, correct places and the first real owners and content are in place.

## Business rules

- Imported places are owned by the super admin so they are visible without a subscription. When the real owner joins, move the firm to their account from the dashboard (the owner must be a registered `firm_admin`).
- Doubtful places are checked by a person before they stay listed (D-02).

## Definition of done

- [ ] The seven doubtful places are checked and kept, suspended or removed.
- [ ] Every pharmacy, clinic and hospital has a phone number or a note why not.
- [ ] Ten real owners are onboarded.

